            "context": "Convened by Reinhard Heydrich at a lakeside villa in Wannsee, Berlin, 15 senior government ministry directors, jurists, and SS generals met for 90 minutes over cognac to coordinate the state machinery for deporting and exterminating 11 million European Jews. **Hinge Question:** How does the Wannsee Protocol prove that the \"Final Solution\" was an enterprise of the entire German civil service, not merely rogue SS fanatics?",
