            "context": "Codenamed *Aktion Reinhard* in memory of Heydrich, these three purpose-built death camps existed solely to murder. Victims were stripped and forced directly into carbon monoxide gas chambers within two hours of arrival; over 1.7 million Jews were murdered in under 18 months. **Hinge Question:** Why is the Höfle Telegram considered one of the most conclusive pieces of documentary evidence verifying the scale of Operation Reinhard?",
