            "context": "In *The Destruction of the European Jews*, historian Raul Hilberg demonstrated that the genocide was executed not by monsters, but by clerks, engineers, and accountants operating standard administrative routines. **Hinge Question:** How does an ordinary railway timetable illustrate the concept of the \"banality of evil\" formulated by philosopher Hannah Arendt?",
