            "caption": "Soldiers of the British Army 11th Armoured Division and Royal Army Medical Corps (RAMC) entering the Bergen-Belsen concentration camp alongside surviving inmates, April 1945. British forces discovered over 60,000 starving, typhus-stricken prisoners and thousands of unburied corpses, providing the British public with first-hand photographic proof of Nazi atrocities.",
